<title>GERMANY: Pan-German Dec adjusted unemployment rises 48,000.</title>
<headline>Pan-German Dec adjusted unemployment rises 48,000.</headline>
<text>
<p>NUREMBERG, Germany, Jan 9 Reuter) - The Federal Labour Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT   Dec 96	Nov 96	   Dec 95</p>
<p> Number (unadj)		4.148 mln   3.942 mln	3.791 mln</p>
<p> Number (adj)		  4.156 mln   4.108 mln	3.808 mln</p>
<p> Change in adj number     +48,000     +50,000	   n/a</p>
<p> Rate (unadj)		  10.8 pct    10.3 pct	 9.9 pct</p>
<p> Short-time workers	  204,670     215,504	  230,885</p>
<p> Vacancies (unadj)	   270,913     276,001	  255,928</p>
<p> Change in numbers in work Oct 96	Sept 96</p>
<p>				  -41,000	-51,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Numbers in work data refer to change from previous month. Details on numbers in work to be released later today.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
